  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\ns=1+2 x+3 x^2 .\n$$\n.$\\infty$\nHints : $\\frac{x S=x+2 x^2+\\ldots \\ldots \\ldots \\ldots}{s(1-x)=1+x+x^2+\\ldots \\ldots \\ldots . \\infty}$\n$$\ns=\\frac{1}{(1-x)^2}\n$$\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{1}{1-x}, f(x)=(1-x)^{-1}=1+x+x^2+x^3 \\ldots \\ldots \\ldots \\ldots . . .0=1\n$$",
